  "details": "You can give a friend a Vice Role, this is where their friends can either join in your world (depending on the world type). \nWithout the need to add the main host user. It all varies on the world itself if its been hosted Invite, Invite+, Friends.\nThis can be helpful in alot of ways, not just what been described above. \nFor example: A friend decided to fall asleep in their main home world, if they place you as Vice. You could go see a friend an come back. Without the need of losing one way ticket back to your friend if you wanted to sleep with them. (but of course it all varies of the option from the home user, of what the Vice Person is allowed to do. If they allow to bring their friends in or not etc)\nThe Home user to place their friend as Vices also have other settings as well to the person. Like Friends able to join, able to come back etc.",
